<article class="env-lemma" id="0DH8">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0DH8">Lemma <span data-tag="0DH8">85.33.4</span>.</a> Let $S$ be a scheme. Let $X$ be an algebraic space over $S$. Let $U$ be a simplicial algebraic space over $S$. Let $a : U \to X$ be an augmentation. If $a : U \to X$ is an fppf hypercovering of $X$, then </p>
  <div class="equation">
  \[  R\Gamma (X_{\acute{e}tale}, K) = R\Gamma (U_{\acute{e}tale}, a^{-1}K)  \]
</div>
  <p> for $K \in D^+(X_{\acute{e}tale})$. Here $a : \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (U_{\acute{e}tale}) \to \mathop{\mathit{Sh}}\nolimits (X_{\acute{e}tale})$ is as in Section <a href="/tag/0DE7" data-tag="0DE7">85.32</a>. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      This follows from Lemma <a href="/tag/0DH7" data-tag="0DH7">85.33.3</a> because $R\Gamma (U_{\acute{e}tale}, -) = R\Gamma (X_{\acute{e}tale}, -) \circ Ra_*$ by Cohomology on Sites, Remark <a href="/tag/08J6" data-tag="08J6">21.14.4</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>